# Step 5 of #2741 (first slice): the command packages, one per CLI command
# family. Declarations two or more commands still share stay in the root
# package for now; the primitive and orchestration steps take them down.
# The file rules come first; the declaration lines after them are what those
# packages pull down from the root. Re-run `go run ./cmd/pkgmove apply -map
# cmd/pkgmove/maps/05-command.map -importers ...` after rebasing onto it.
rename listEnvironmentResult NewListEnvironmentResult
rename listSSHResult NewListSSHResult
rename resolveGatewayCredential ResolveGatewayCredentialFromStore
rename resolvePublishedDevopsDeploySpec ResolvePublishedDevopsDeploySpecWithOverrides
rename chartNameFromReference ChartName
